From 806f1a391b9de0acc5f482a5d6712f450733a215 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raf <raf@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:03:31 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] panels: slide an open attached panel to a new click anchor;
 noctalia.openPanel

openPanel() on the already open attached panel (open near click) now moves
the surface along the bar with an eased animation instead of destroying and
reopening it. The bar seam/shadow cut-out, click shield rect and content-fit
geometry follow. Plugins get noctalia.openPanel(id): open, never close; from a
bar widget the request carries the pointer anchor, so a menu bar's dropdown can
follow the hovered title (plugin API 54).
